<title>UK: Trinkaus sets warrants on dlr/mark and yen/mark.</title>
<headline>Trinkaus sets warrants on dlr/mark and yen/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt said it had issued 270 million European-style call and put warrants, in 27 equal tranches, on the U.S dollar/mark and yen/mark exchange rate.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   19.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUSSELDORF, STUTTGART, FRANKFURT</p>
<p> SPOT REF  MARK/DLR - 1.5550 DEM.MARK/YEN 1.3650 PER 100 YEN</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
